1317
01:23:45,300 --> 01:23:47,386
<font color="#ffff80">neste caso, eu estaria pronto</font>

1318
01:23:47,631 --> 01:23:49,731
<font color="#ffff80">a levá-las em consideração.</font>

1319
01:23:51,393 --> 01:23:53,171
<font color="#ffff80">Obrigado, primeiro-ministro.</font>

1320
01:23:54,634 --> 01:23:57,567
<font color="#ffff80">Prepararemos imediatamente
um rascunho do memorando.</font>

1321
01:24:09,281 --> 01:24:13,409
<font color="#ffff80">Venho pensando,</font>

1322
01:24:13,831 --> 01:24:16,281
<font color="#ffff80">nesses últimos dias,</font>

1323
01:24:21,170 --> 01:24:23,655
<font color="#ffff80">se seria...</font>

1324
01:24:26,483 --> 01:24:28,083
<font color="#ffff80">parte do meu dever</font>

1325
01:24:33,136 --> 01:24:36,407
<font color="#ffff80">parte de...
parte do meu dever, sim,</font>

1326
01:24:40,391 --> 01:24:41,891
<font color="#ffff80">considerar...</font>

1327
01:24:43,564 --> 01:24:45,064
<font color="#ffff80">considerar...</font>

1328
01:24:51,870 --> 01:24:53,470
<font color="#ffff80">considerar...</font>

1329
01:24:56,091 --> 01:24:58,630
<font color="#ffff80">se seria...</font>

1330
01:24:59,472 --> 01:25:02,240
<font color="#ffff80">Não precisa de mais nada
para esta noite, senhor?</font>

1331
01:25:05,577 --> 01:25:08,236
<font color="#ffff80">se seria parte do meu dever</font>

1332
01:25:09,852 --> 01:25:12,596
<font color="#ffff80">empreender...</font>

1333
01:25:14,539 --> 01:25:16,873
<font color="#ffff80">negociações com aquele...</font>

1334
01:25:17,287 --> 01:25:21,913
<font color="#ffff80">HITLER DESAFIADOR
IMPLACÁVEL NO ATAQUE</font>

1335
01:25:21,914 --> 01:25:23,413
<font color="#ffff80">aquele...</font>

1336
01:25:25,534 --> 01:25:27,034
<font color="#ffff80">aquele cabo...</font>

1337
01:25:32,101 --> 01:25:35,022
<font color="#ffff80">Não.
Aquele... "heil Hitler"...</font>

1338
01:25:38,850 --> 01:25:42,756
<font color="#ffff80">tirano...
