1339
01:25:44,376 --> 01:25:46,115
<font color="#ffff80">açougueiro... aquele...</font>

1340
01:25:46,952 --> 01:25:49,291
<font color="#ffff80">aquele monstruoso...</font>

1341
01:25:49,902 --> 01:25:51,403
<font color="#ffff80">selvagem.</font>

1342
01:25:58,091 --> 01:26:00,972
<font color="#ffff80">Aquele... aquele... aquele...</font>

1343
01:26:07,164 --> 01:26:08,663
<font color="#ffff80">aquele pintor de paredes!</font>

1344
01:26:16,614 --> 01:26:18,263
<font color="#ffff80">Onde estávamos?</font>

1345
01:26:22,127 --> 01:26:23,627
<font color="#ffff80">E então?</font>

1346
01:26:26,072 --> 01:26:27,923
<font color="#ffff80">Não entendi, senhor.</font>

1347
01:26:29,670 --> 01:26:31,171
<font color="#ffff80">O senhor estava...</font>

1348
01:26:31,579 --> 01:26:33,079
